        <li><b>Priority.</b> The priority determines the launch sequence of components in cases where their ordinal numbers are the same for a given user role.</li>
        <li><b>Route.</b> The launch route for a web application component.</li>
        <li><b>Component Type.</b> The type of the component being launched; indicates whether the item is an independent module or a module extension.</li>
        <li><b>Module / Extension.</b> The name of the component to be launched: either a module or a module extension.</li>
        <li><b>Enabled.</b> If this flag is set, the component will be launched every time a user with the specified role logs into the Control Panel.</li>
